      ":question/problem": "![](images/ef/effe6d3f4731494d98266ab992e99ab6a55d8c95e15101ad13b3aa16c6f2347c.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the ellipse shown above.",
